    "enUS": {
      "description": "The war against the Horde is quickly depleting our supplies, {name}.  It is vital to maintain control of Arathi Basin to keep the stream of resources flowing!  Have you lent a hand in Arathi yet?",
      "dialogue": {
        "b91a0441c2fae88458fd": "Good work, soldier! Keep it up and we'll have the Horde running all the way back to Orgrimmar.",
        "c4a345b8028cbae325eb": "The war against the Horde is quickly depleting our supplies, $n.  It is vital to maintain control of Arathi Basin to keep the stream of resources flowing!  Have you lent a hand in Arathi yet?"
